 "remarks": "Peaceful 4BR Retreat on 1.9 Acres. Charming 4-bed, 3-bath home on nearly 2 acres of wooded privacy in backcountry Greenwich. Built as an artist's retreat, the 4,576 sq. ft. home features pine accents, a newly renovated kitchen and living room, a first-floor bedroom, and a magical top-floor playroom. Work from home in the private office or detached studio. Enjoy fresh paint, polished wood floors, a full-house generator, and abundant storage. Just 10 mins to downtown, 6 mins to Glenville shopping. Top schools, hiking trails, golf, and more are all nearby.",
